# Types the green-roof sensors against the classes declared in the OCBV TBox.
#
# Both were authored as bare brick:Sensor, so the graph knew they existed and not what they
# measured -- which is why the timeseries linker refused to route them anywhere. Brick 1.4
# has no class for either quantity; see ontology/ontosage_schema.ttl.

@prefix bldg: <http://abacwsbuilding.cardiff.ac.uk/abacws#> .
@prefix ontosage: <http://ontosage.org/capabilities#> .

bldg:GreenRoof_SoilMoisture_Sensor a ontosage:Soil_Moisture_Sensor .
bldg:GreenRoof_Rainfall_Sensor a ontosage:Rainfall_Sensor .
